  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a warm welcome to guests with its faith-based design. Featuring an uplifting Bible verse and customizable text, it serves as a meaningful accent for any home. It combines spiritual inspiration with practical home decor, making it a special addition to your entryway.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with family name, initial, or custom text alongside a Bible verse</li>\n<li>Features inspirational, scripture-based designs</li>\n<li>Soft, lightweight, and comfortable underfoot</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and covered outdoor use</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text Customization</td>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool, Polyester Fabric, Memory Stretch Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Suede</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Gently soak with dry duster cloth for liquids, vacuum or sweep for solid waste, wipe with damp cloth and mild soap for deeper cleaning, or flush with garden hose outdoors</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is ideal for welcoming guests at entrances, front porches, and entryways. It also serves as a thoughtful decorative accent in various indoor settings, enhancing the spiritual ambiance of your home.</p>",
